# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mokosh Client - environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and edit. Values are read by `docker compose`
# and forwarded into the dev container, where `dx serve` invokes `cargo` /
# `rustc` and bakes them into the WASM bundle via `option_env!`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Login bypass (DEV ONLY).
#
# When both ADMIN_EMAIL and ADMIN_PASSWORD are set AND non-empty at compile
# time, the WASM client starts pre-authenticated as this admin user and the
# login screen redirects straight to the dashboard. Bypass is baked into the
# bundle at build time; changing these values requires rebuilding.
#
# Leave both unset (or empty) to use the normal login screen.
#
# Do NOT use these values outside local development. The bundle is shipped
# to every browser - anyone who downloads it can read both fields.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=devpassword12
